From 4cc26a530678bc4bd17c5202580cc0f83e6b4ad1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bazel z/OS Port <bazel@zos.build>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 03:04:49 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] z/OS: Tag scripts as ASCII before execution

Add chtag command to tag scripts as ISO8859-1 (ASCII) before execution
on z/OS to prevent 'Exec format error'.
---
 tools/cpp/unix_cc_configure.bzl | 701 +-------------------------------
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 700 deletions(-)

